  "key": "SFCC-795",
  "summary": "Cart Item Component UI (Part 2) - PWA Kit Component",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, **I want** to see a consistent and complete cart item tile in my bag, **so that** I can review my selections before proceeding to checkout.\n\nThis serves as a Part 2 to [SFCC-270](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-270) and covers the full UI kit of the cart item component, including error states, warning states, promotional states, responsive behaviour, and accessibility. \n\nThis is a **PWA Kit component story focused on UI only**. It covers the build of the Cart Item React component — the individual product tile that renders for each line item in the cart. This story is UI-only. \n\nThe Cart Item component renders the following elements per line item: product image, product name, price, colour, size, quantity stepper (+ and - controls), Remove link, and Wishlist link. All data is served from SFCC via PWA Kit. Hover/focus/active visual states are defined in the UI kit and are not repeated here.\n\nNote: error/warning/promotional text can be configurable. This story doesn’t assume final copy. \n\n*Design UI Kit:* [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=TmtWOmzv22deb8Pq-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026) \n\n![\"image-20260826-002407.png\"](image-20260826-002407.png)",
